sections.content:
In this Act, unless the context otherwise requires,--

(a) "Council" means the North-Eastern Council set up under section 3;

^1[(b) "north-eastern area" means the area comprising the States of Arunachal Pradesh, Assam,
Manipur, Meghalaya, Mizoram,^2[Nagaland, Sikkim and Tripura]];
